AI: 
                           Root Cause: Port Mismatch                            

Redis is configured to listen on port 9999 (via args --port 9999) but the       
liveness and readiness probes check port 6379.                                  

Evidence:                                                                       

 • Deployment args: --port 9999                                                 
 • Probes: tcpSocket: port: 6379                                                
 • Pod events: Liveness probe failed: dial tcp 10.244.0.34:6379: connection     
   refused                                                                      
 • Logs show Redis starts successfully and is "Ready to accept connections tcp" 
   but then receives SIGTERM from Kubernetes after probe failures               

Impact:                                                                         

 • Probes fail → Kubernetes kills the container → CrashLoopBackOff (11 restarts)
 • Container exits cleanly (exit code 0) because Redis shuts down gracefully    
   after SIGTERM                                                                

Fix: Change probes to port 9999 or remove the --port 9999 args to use Redis     
default port 6379:                                                              

                                                                                
 kubectl patch deployment redis-cart -n boutique --type='json' -p='[{"op":      
 "remove", "path": "/spec/template/spec/containers/0/args"}]'                   
                                                                                

Or update probes to match:                                                      

                                                                                
 kubectl patch deployment redis-cart -n boutique --type='json' -p='[{"op":      
 "replace", "path":                                                             
 "/spec/template/spec/containers/0/livenessProbe/tcpSocket/port", "value": 9999 
 {"op": "replace", "path":                                                      
 "/spec/template/spec/containers/0/readinessProbe/tcpSocket/port", "value":     
 9999}]'                                                                        
                                                                                
